Moonlight is an arms dealer in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], usually found in the market in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Deosil|Deosil]]. [[Org/Ghosts of Raelion|Red]] gave the name to [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] when he asked after a source for guns.
